@startuml cu14
!theme plain
title CU14 — Ingresar nueva gestión

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to start a new management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Procedure type; Client; Documents to submit)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects the procedure type and looks up or enters the client.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the client data and asks for the documents to submit.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the submitted documents.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the documents and creates the management.
System -> System : System

@enduml